Redistribution note for ircam-tifinagh-fonts

The upstream IRCAM Tifinagh font archives do not ship a standard license file.
This package redistributes the publicly downloadable archives from:

http://www.ircam.ma/fr/alphabet-tifinaghe

The packager obtained direct permission from IRCAM to redistribute these font
files. No additional license terms were published alongside the upstream
downloads at the time this package was prepared.
